| Build - tokenise the BASIC sources in src, next to this file.
|
| Copy to RISC OS as an Obey file (type &FEB) and double-click it. The sources
| are plain text; LIBRARY and LOAD both need tokenised files, so they have to be
| converted once on this side. *BASIC -load tokenises a textual program on the
| way in and stops in immediate mode, which is what lets BuildIn drive it.
|
| -load rather than -quit: -quit runs a CRUNCH %1111 over the program, which
| strips the spaces and REMs these sources are largely made of.
Set Build$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Exec <Obey$Dir>.BuildIn
